        "score": 9,
        "rationale": "The library code in src/lib.rs has no unwrap, expect or unsafe, and errors are handled with matches; one risk is that the tests call std::env::set_var/remove_var outside an unsafe block, which would not compile under the 2024 edition, and nothing was compiled to check."
